  <running_head>HORRENDA EXEMPLA</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l>Quis est homo, q nō flẽret</l>
    <l>Matrē Christi, si videret</l>
    <l>In tanto supplicio?</l>
    <l>Quis nō posset cōtristari,</l>
    <l>Piam matrē contemplari,</l>
    <l>Dolentem cum Filio.</l>
    <l>Pro peccatis suæ gentis</l>
    <l>Vidit Iesum in tormētis,</l>
    <l>Et flagellis subditum,</l>
    <l>Videns suum dulcē Natū</l>
    <l>Morientem desolatum</l>
    <l>Cūm emisit Spiritum.</l>
    <l>Eja mater fons amoris,</l>
    <l>Me sentire vim doloris</l>
    <l>Fac ut tecum lugeam,</l>
    <l>Fac ut ardeat cor meum,</l>
    <l>In amādo Christum Deū,</l>
    <l>Ut sibi complaceam.</l>
    <l>Sancta mater istud agas,</l>
    <l>Crucifixi fige plagas,</l>
    <l>Cordi meo valide</l>
    <l>Tui Nati vulnerati</l>
    <l>Iām dignāri pro me pati,</l>
    <l>Pœnās mecum divide.</l>
    <l>Fac me vere te cum flere,</l>
    <l>Crucifixo condolere,</l>
    <l>Donec ego vixero,</l>
    <l>Iuxta crucem tecum stare,</l>
    <l>Et me tibi sociare</l>
    <l>In planctu desidero.</l>
    <l>Virgo virginum præclara,</l>
    <l>Mihi iam non fis amara</l>
    <l>Fac me tecum plangere,</l>
    <l>Fac ut portē Christi mortem</l>
    <l>Passionis ejus fortem (te</l>
    <l>Et plagas recolere.</l>
    <l>Fac me plagis vulnerari</l>
    <l>Utiq; fac me beari</l>
    <l>Cum cruore filii;</l>
    <l>Inflammatus ac incensus</l>
    <l>Per te, virgo, sim defensus</l>
    <l>In die judicii.</l>
    <l>Fac me custodiri;</l>
    <l>Morte Christi præmuniri</l>
    <l>Confoveri gratia,</l>
    <l>Quādo corpus morietur,</l>
    <l>Fac ut animæ donetur</l>
    <l>Paradisi gloria. Amen.</l>
    <l>ALIA.</l>
    <l>Ave mundi spes Maria,</l>
    <l>Ave mitis, ave pia,</l>
    <l>Ave plena gratia.</l>
    <l>Ave virgo Mater Christi,</l>
    <l>Tu quæ sola meruisti</l>
    <l>Esse mater sine viro,</l>
    <l>Et lactare more miro.</l>
    <l>Angelorum imperatrix</l>
    <l>Peccatorum consolatrix,</l>
    <l>Consolare me lugentem</l>
    <l>In peccatis iam fœtentem.</l>
    <p type="foot">Consola</p>
  </main_text>
